# The downloads behind the sky data (sky_sources.py), each kept in the cache
# (~/.cache/voyager-sky, or --cache) under its name and fetched only once.
#
#   modern.json          Stellarium's "modern" sky culture: stick figures, and the
#                        illustrations install-stellarium-figures.py fetches beside it
#   hyg.csv              the HYG star catalogue v4.1, from Hipparcos
#   starmap_2020_4k.exr  NASA SVS Deep Star Maps 2020: the Milky Way
#   roman87.dat          Roman (1987), CDS VI/42: the IAU boundaries (Delporte 1930) as
#                        B1875 boxes. Astropy's copy, as the CDS host is not always reachable.
#
# name                 url
modern.json            https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stellarium/stellarium/master/skycultures/modern/index.json
hyg.csv                https://raw.githubusercontent.com/astronexus/HYG-Database/main/hyg/CURRENT/hygdata_v41.csv
starmap_2020_4k.exr    https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/vis/a000000/a004800/a004851/starmap_2020_4k.exr
roman87.dat            https://raw.githubusercontent.com/astropy/astropy/main/astropy/coordinates/data/constellation_data_roman87.dat
